sequenceDiagram
    participant Infra as Docker/App
    participant Provider as Agent Discovery Provider
    participant Inv as Inventory Registry
    participant Cap as Capability Resolver
    participant Config as Configuration Provisioner
    participant OTel as OTel Observer + Receiver Creator
    Infra-->>Provider: Docker metadata/snapshot
    Provider->>Inv: Commit complete scoped observations
    Inv->>Cap: Resource + provenance
    Cap->>Config: Supported preconfigured capability needed
    Config->>Config: CAS rule revision / no-op if unchanged
    Config-->>OTel: Validated Collector configuration generation
    Infra-->>OTel: Endpoint start/stop observed
    OTel->>OTel: Create/delete receiver instance on rule match
    Note over OTel: No per-service approval; no unknown receiver auto-creation
